    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/life-coach-agency/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Life Coach Agency theme is a refined and flexible website solution designed for coacher professionals, personal development experts, business guides, fitness trainers, and metor specialists. It features a clean, modern layout that helps present coaching services clearly, inspire visitors, and build a strong digital presence. With customizable options, users can easily align the design with their brand identity and goals. It includes ready-made layouts for key sections like home, about, services, blog, and contact, ensuring a consistent and polished appearance. The user-friendly drag-and-drop builder simplifies content creation and updates without technical skills. The theme supports appointment booking, responsive design for all devices, and social media integration to boost engagement. Built with performance and SEO in mind, it improves visibility and speed. Ideal for personal coaching, career guidance, and growth-focused services, it offers a professional platform to expand your coaching business."
    },
